# Personal artefacts — internal-only, not part of the public artifact
# These exist locally for sprint-tracking but are not load-bearing for the
# public README / submission. Add anything personal here.
MENTOR-REVIEW.md
data/

# Encrypted on-disk caches (regenerated at runtime)
**/corpus-text-cache.json.enc

# Research notes — kept local until consolidated. Reintroduce when ready.
docs/research/

# Internal-only docs (X drafts, pitch deck draft, demo recording fallback
# tree). Their substance lives in PRODUCTION-VISION.md + HACKATHON-MVP.md in
# repo-ready form; the originals reference internal mentor-review artifacts.
docs/X-POST-DRAFTS.md
docs/PITCH-DECK.md
docs/DEMO-FALLBACK.md

# Source asset folders — the *built* outputs of these live in
# frontend/public/ and frontend/src/fonts/ where the app actually uses them.
# The source folders contain redundant copies and (for Coolvetica) a vendor
# EULA PDF that we don't redistribute.
favicon/
coolvetica/
favicon.zip
coolvetica.zip

